5,0,1,talk,Misaki,,Let's start calmly. Does anyone have any initial thoughts?,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,...Skip.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Asuka,,I will observe everyone's behavior for now.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. It is too early to make any assumptions.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Midori,,I hope we can all get along and find the werewolf together.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
