11,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,...I'm just... a bit nervous.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"Being nervous is natural, but logic is what will save us.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,Indeed. Let us focus on the patterns of speech.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Midori,,Please don't be too hard on Daisuke-kun. We are all in this together.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
