31,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"The first night has passed. If the Seer found something, they might be considering how to reveal it.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,...I don't know what to say.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I have information. Ryuji is the werewolf.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"That is a bold claim, Asuka. I am a villager.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Oh dear, such a strong accusation so early. Are you sure, Asuka-san?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Asuka, are you claiming to be the Seer?","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,...Is that really true?,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"Yes, I am the Seer. My divination was clear. Ryuji is the werewolf.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,A common tactic for the werewolf is to fake being the Seer to eliminate a threat.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Midori,,It's a difficult situation. We have to decide who to trust.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"If Asuka is the Seer, we should execute Ryuji. If Asuka is the werewolf, she is trying to frame him.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,...I... I don't want to make a mistake.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"The logic is simple. If I were the werewolf, I would not risk such a direct claim on day one.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"On the contrary, a direct claim is the fastest way to gain control of the vote.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Midori,,I feel for both of you. But we must make a choice for the village.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I will trust the Seer's claim for now. It's the most proactive lead we have.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,...If everyone thinks so... I'll follow.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I am certain. Let us end this now.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"I cannot change your minds with words alone, but this is a mistake.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Midori,,I'll go with the majority to keep the peace. I'll vote for Ryuji.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
